      "changelog": "https://github.com/tashifkhan/Patchwork/releases",
      "suggestedVersionCode": "13",
      "description": "Patchwork pulls your tasks out of the places they're scattered across and\nputs them in one app.\n\nWhat it connects to:\n\n* CalDAV tasks from Nextcloud or any CalDAV server, with subtasks, tags,\n  priorities, due dates, reminders and Markdown notes\n* Nextcloud Deck boards, with drag and drop for cards and columns\n* Jira boards with sprints, a backlog and a full issue editor\n* GitHub issues across repositories\n* More than one GitHub or Jira account at a time\n\nOther features:\n\n* AI import that drafts tasks from a photo of handwritten notes or a\n  description. You review every task before it's saved\n* Bring your own model: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, OpenRouter,\n  NVIDIA, OpenCode Zen, RelayRoom or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint\n* Voice dictation\n* Home screen widgets for today and upcoming tasks\n* Material You colours, fixed palettes, high contrast and a pure black\n  AMOLED mode\n* Layouts for tablets and foldables\n\nCredentials and API keys stay on the device in secure storage, and the app\ntalks to your servers directly.\n\nSlack and Linear integrations are planned.\n",
